Alec worked on the show multiple seasons as our new media coordinator.
亚历克作为我们的新媒体协调员参与了该剧多个季的工作。

00:46:11.000 --> 00:46:18.440
He did the in production podcast, which we did for a few years on the show and he did all the sort of internet presence and DVD extras and all the stuff.
他制作了制作中的播客，我们在节目中做了几年，他还制作了所有的互联网节目和 DVD 附加节目以及所有的东西。

